<title>NETHERLANDS: ENDEMOL PULLS OUT OF A'DAM LEISURE SCHEME.</title>
<headline>ENDEMOL PULLS OUT OF A'DAM LEISURE SCHEME.</headline>
<dateline>LAREN, Netherlands 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch television production company Endemol Entertainment NV said on Friday it had decided to withraw from a planned entertainment complex near the new Arena sports stadium in south-east Amsterdam.</p>
</text>
